              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "چادر زدن (châdor zadan) — \"to pitch a tent, to camp\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ما کنار رودخانه چادر زدیم. mâ kenâr-e rudkhâne châdor zadim. We pitched a tent by the river."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "châdor 'tent; veil' + zadan 'to strike'; present stem zan-."
            }
          ]
        },
